      }
    },
    {
      "category": "coverage_limitation",
      "finding": "All 252 benchmark, 1920 expansion and 240 stress entries have no modeled daylight minute within the response horizon under the night_aircraft rule. They cannot test usable aircraft response regardless of readiness; expansion adds no daytime aircraft coverage.",
      "basis": "wildfire-scenario-quality-v1 night_aircraft rule; findings_by_code equals task count for each catalog",
      "follow_up": "Track a preregistered future-version daytime aircraft coverage design under #18/#34; do not alter or regenerate frozen catalogs. Incident-day full-day cases have daylight windows but are development probes, not held-out training coverage."
    },
    {
      "category": "unsupported_or_unvalidated",
      "finding": "One landscape; 80 shared source-unknown fuel cells use explicit exercise fallback; travel, communications, population, safety, suppression and fire rates are uncalibrated. Source-map land/water uncertainty, road permissions and native elevation void/edition metadata remain open."
    },
    {
